{"id":"6f7262f71f82d22a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_STEraseRow.md","title":"STEraseRow","display":"STEraseRow","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"STEraseRow","parameters":["z1752","z1753","z1754"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"STEraseRow"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>z1752</span><span>z1753</span><span>z1754</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：Curry 简单类型算法。有序参数：<code>z1752</code>、<code>z1753</code>、<code>z1754</code>。</p>\n<p>擦去简单类型 λ 注解；只对无常项的此接口使用。：单行局部条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ STEraseRow z1752 z1753 z1754)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists t\n  (exists u\n    (and\n      (@ Pair t u z1754)\n      (or\n        (exists z1757 (and (@ Nat z1757) (and (@ TVar z1757 t) (= t u))))\n        (or\n          (exists z1758\n            (exists z1759\n              (exists z1760\n                (and\n                  (@ TLam z1758 z1759 t)\n                  (and\n                    (@ ULam z1760 u)\n                    (exists z1765\n                      (exists z1766 (and (in z1765 z1753) (and (@ App z1752 z1765 z1766) (@ Pair z1759 z1760 z1766))))))))))\n          (exists z1761\n            (exists z1762\n              (exists z1763\n                (exists z1764\n                  (and\n                    (@ TApp z1761 z1762 t)\n                    (and\n                      (@ TApp z1763 z1764 u)\n                      (and\n                        (exists z1767\n                          (exists z1768 (and (in z1767 z1753) (and (@ App z1752 z1767 z1768) (@ Pair z1761 z1763 z1768)))))\n                        (exists z1769\n                          (exists z1770 (and (in z1769 z1753) (and (@ App z1752 z1769 z1770) (@ Pair z1762 z1764 z1770)))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a7fe33bb2e95221\" href=\"?note=0a7fe33bb2e95221\" title=\"ZFC_Pair\">Pair</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ee8586c4703b19e\" href=\"?note=8ee8586c4703b19e\" title=\"ZFC_TApp\">TApp</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" href=\"?note=59c4a3ef7b6eaded\" title=\"ZFC_TLam\">TLam</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"00213bb93d499434\" href=\"?note=00213bb93d499434\" title=\"ZFC_TVar\">TVar</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"f077e9016ad9f66b\" href=\"?note=f077e9016ad9f66b\" title=\"ZFC_ULam\">ULam</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ STEraseRow z1752 z1753 z1754)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_App","status":"resolved","id":"8bd25e131370b9c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":